      "preuve": "Verbatim 10-K FY2026 : \"Recently announced and future U.S. tariffs, retaliatory trade measures and other trade restrictions... may have a material adverse impact on our results of operations\" ; \"In February 2026, the U.S. Supreme Court ruled that tariffs imposed under the International Emergency Economic Powers Act were not authorized, creating uncertainty around the status of prior tariffs\"."
